"手动上游与单模型是持久配置，不会过期。主动发现服务不可用时自动移除；程序注册服务按 heartbeat_after_seconds 发送心跳，heartbeat_timeout_seconds 默认 90 秒，兼容 ttl_seconds。healthy=false 立即下线；携带完整注册快照的心跳可在短暂掉线或网关重启后自动恢复。目录下线不释放运行中的资源，仍需停止确认。":["Manual providers and single models are persistent. Discovered services disappear when unavailable. Registered services send heartbeats at heartbeat_after_seconds; heartbeat_timeout_seconds defaults to 90, with ttl_seconds retained as an alias. healthy=false removes a service immediately. Full-snapshot heartbeats recover after disconnects or gateway restarts. Removing a catalog entry never releases running resources without stop confirmation.", "手動上游與單模型為持久設定，不會過期。主動探索服務無法使用時自動移除；程式註冊服務依 heartbeat_after_seconds 傳送心跳，heartbeat_timeout_seconds 預設 90 秒，相容 ttl_seconds。healthy=false 立即下線；完整註冊快照心跳可在短暫斷線或網關重啟後自動恢復。目錄下線不釋放執行中的資源，仍需停止確認。"],

