"Auto 路由方式可选 rules、request_type、context_size、llm、systemone/jev。前三种无需分类模型；请求类型用 X-VScheduler-Auto-Task 与 request_type_tiers，长度策略用 context_simple_max_tokens/context_standard_max_tokens。聊天分类 llm 从现有 Chat Completions 上游选择，沿用 jev_model/jev_upstream_id，云端须单独许可；所有方式共用候选白名单与资源准入。":["Choose rules, request_type, context_size, llm or systemone/jev. The first three need no classifier model. Request types use X-VScheduler-Auto-Task and request_type_tiers; size routing uses context_simple_max_tokens/context_standard_max_tokens. LLM classification selects an existing Chat Completions model using jev_model/jev_upstream_id, with separate cloud consent. All modes keep the candidate allowlist and resource admission.", "Auto 可選 rules、request_type、context_size、llm、systemone/jev。前三種無需分類模型；類型使用 X-VScheduler-Auto-Task 與 request_type_tiers；長度使用兩個 context 上限。llm 從現有聊天上游選擇，沿用 jev_model/jev_upstream_id，雲端另須許可。所有方式共用候選白名單與資源准入。"],
