"V-Voice 0.0.27 保留 ONNX、声纹与 audio.cpp GGUF，移除四个 PyTorch 原生音乐模型；绑定以实际就绪模型和匹配审批为准。":["V-Voice 0.0.27 retains ONNX, speaker recognition and audio.cpp GGUF while retiring four PyTorch native music models. Bindings require ready models and matching approvals.", "V-Voice 0.0.27 保留 ONNX、聲紋與 audio.cpp GGUF，移除四個 PyTorch 原生音樂模型；繫結以實際就緒模型與匹配審批為準。"],
"Provider 与模型能力":["Providers and model capabilities", "Provider 與模型能力"],
"Ollama 模型通过 /api/show 自动读取 completion、vision、tools、thinking、embedding、decision 等实际能力，内置实例与手动添加的实例使用同一逻辑。旧版 OpenAI 兼容配置通过 /api/version 识别；读取失败保留已有信息。手动修改后刷新不会覆盖，点击「重新识别上游能力」可恢复自动识别。":["Ollama models report completion, vision, tools, thinking, embedding, decision and other supported capabilities through /api/show. Built-in and manually added instances share discovery logic. Legacy OpenAI-compatible entries are recognized through /api/version; failed discovery preserves existing metadata. Refresh keeps manual overrides; choose Rediscover upstream capabilities to resume automatic discovery.", "Ollama 模型透過 /api/show 自動讀取 completion、vision、tools、thinking、embedding、decision 等實際能力；內建與手動新增實例共用邏輯。舊版 OpenAI 相容設定透過 /api/version 識別；讀取失敗保留原資訊。手動修改後重新整理不覆蓋，點選「重新識別上游能力」可恢復自動識別。"],
"能力和接口数组省略或为空时保留自动识别或默认值；注册只声明模型，不自动授予资源预算、执行器审批或强制放行权限。":["Omitted or empty capability and endpoint arrays retain discovery or defaults. Registration declares models only; it does not grant resource budgets, executor approval or forced admission.","能力與介面陣列省略或為空時保留自動識別或預設值；註冊僅聲明模型，不自動授予資源預算、執行器核准或強制放行權限。"],
"模型注册 API 与自动能力识别":["Model registration and automatic capabilities","模型註冊 API 與自動能力識別"],
"POST /api/v1/registrations 支持 ollama、typesafe 及现有协议。Ollama 可省略 models 自动发现，也可用 model 或 models 指定子集；两种方式均读取 /api/show，自动识别 vision、tools、thinking、embedding、rerank、decision。能力与接口覆盖顺序为自动识别、顶层 capabilities/endpoints、models 内逐模型声明、model_capabilities/model_endpoints 映射；后者优先，声明能力而未声明接口时重新推断接口，避免专用模型误带聊天接口。普通聊天无声明默认 Chat Completions；Jev 为 decision/systemone。心跳维护服务在线状态，失联后自动移除，完整注册快照心跳支持自动恢复；模型或能力变更时使用相同 service_id 重新注册。":["POST /api/v1/registrations supports ollama, typesafe and existing protocols. Omit models to discover Ollama models, or specify model/models; both read /api/show. Capability/endpoint precedence is discovery, top-level declarations, individual models, then model_capabilities/model_endpoints maps. Capability-only overrides infer fresh endpoints so specialized models do not retain chat interfaces. Undeclared chat models default to Chat Completions; Jev uses decision/systemone. Heartbeats maintain service presence, remove offline entries and recover through full registration snapshots; re-register the same service_id when models or metadata change.","POST /api/v1/registrations 支持 ollama、typesafe 及现有协议。Ollama 可省略 models 自动发现，也可用 model 或 models 指定子集；两种方式均读取 /api/show，自动识别 vision、tools、thinking、embedding、rerank、decision。能力与接口覆盖顺序为自动识别、顶层 capabilities/endpoints、models 内逐模型声明、model_capabilities/model_endpoints 映射；后者优先，声明能力而未声明接口时重新推断接口，避免专用模型误带聊天接口。普通聊天无声明默认 Chat Completions；Jev 为 decision/systemone。心跳维护服务在线状态，失联后自动移除，完整注册快照心跳支持自动恢复；模型或能力变更时使用相同 service_id 重新注册。"],
"Jev 原生决策与中转":["Jev native decisions and proxying", "Jev 原生決策與中轉"],
"上游页面可选厂商预设或自定义中转地址，测试后勾选要导入的模型。模型能力和接口使用复选框；普通聊天上游缺失声明时默认 chat / completion 与 chat_completions，Anthropic 默认 messages。显式接口优先，图片、语音、向量和决策模型不会自动声明为聊天；tools 和 vision 必须按真实能力勾选。":["Select a provider preset or custom proxy URL, test it and select models to import. Capabilities and endpoints use checkboxes. Missing chat metadata defaults to chat/completion and chat_completions; Anthropic defaults to messages. Explicit endpoints take precedence; image, audio, embedding and decision models remain specialized. Declare tools and vision only when actually supported.", "上游頁面可選廠商預設或自訂中轉位址，測試後勾選模型。能力與介面使用核取方塊；一般聊天上游缺失聲明時預設 chat / completion 與 chat_completions，Anthropic 預設 messages。明確介面優先；圖片、語音、向量與決策模型不自動聲明聊天；tools 與 vision 須依實際能力勾選。"],
"TypeSafe / Jev 使用 typesafe 协议和 https://api.typesafe.ai/v1，也可使用实现同协议的自有中转。模型列表读取 models[].name；能力为 decision，接口为 systemone，不会冒充 Harness 聊天模型。工作台选择 System One 后输入包含 state、questions 的 JSON 测试。":["TypeSafe/Jev uses protocol typesafe at https://api.typesafe.ai/v1 or a custom proxy implementing the same protocol. Discovery reads models[].name. Capability decision and endpoint systemone keep it separate from Harness chat models. Select System One in the playground and enter JSON containing state and questions.", "TypeSafe / Jev 使用 typesafe 協定與 https://api.typesafe.ai/v1，也可使用同協定的自有中轉。清單讀取 models[].name；能力 decision、介面 systemone，不冒充 Harness 聊天模型。工作台選擇 System One，輸入含 state、questions 的 JSON 測試。"],
"局域网端口以安装配置为准。同域入口为 /api/com.ictrek.v-scheduler/v1/systemone；鉴权沿用本人 VOS token 或网关 Key，受限应用凭据保留原白名单。供应商密钥保存在网关，请求仅重写模型 ID，保留 state、questions、assets、功能头及原生 answers、概率、置信度和 usage；不支持 SSE。":["The LAN port follows installation settings. Same-origin route: /api/com.ictrek.v-scheduler/v1/systemone. Use your VOS token or gateway key; restricted application credentials retain their allowlist. Provider keys remain server-side. Only model IDs are rewritten; state, questions, assets, feature headers, native answers, probabilities, confidence and usage are preserved. SSE is unsupported.", "區網連接埠依安裝設定。同源入口為 /api/com.ictrek.v-scheduler/v1/systemone；使用本人 VOS token 或閘道 Key，受限應用憑據保留原白名單。廠商金鑰保存在閘道，僅改寫模型 ID，保留 state、questions、assets、功能標頭及原生 answers、機率、信心與 usage；不支援 SSE。"],
